# Orbit evidence withheld from the public repository pending Q-ORB-LICENSE-01.
# EVD-ORB-01 is derived from a CelesTrak-redistributed TLE whose public-redistribution terms are
# unresolved, so its inputs, provenance, raw element set and the GMAT oracle artifacts that embed
# the same element string are kept local only. The fully synthetic EVD-ORB-02 is committed and is
# the public cross-tool gate. See docs/specs/ORBIT_VERIFICATION_CONTRACT.md §11 (Q-ORB-LICENSE-01).
evidence/orbit/EVD-ORB-01/
evidence/orbit/oracle/gmat/EVD-ORB-01*
evidence/orbit/oracle/gmat/raw/EVD-ORB-01*

